---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE, SHOP, breadcrumbSchema, faqSchema, organizationSchema, productSchema, websiteSchema } from '../../data/seoSite';
import { localCityDescription, localCityPages, localCityTitle, localCityUrl, localFaqs, localBusinessSchema } from '../../data/localSeo';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return localCityPages.map((page) => ({ params: { slug: page.slug }, props: { page } }));
}

const { page } = Astro.props;
const canonical = localCityUrl(page);
const title = localCityTitle(page);
const description = localCityDescription(page);
const image = `/images/products/${page.image}`;
const faqs = localFaqs(page);
const relatedCities = localCityPages.filter((item) => item.slug !== page.slug).slice(0, 5);
const schema = [
  organizationSchema(),
  websiteSchema(),
  localBusinessSchema(page),
  productSchema(),
  faqSchema(faqs),
  breadcrumbSchema(`Pantaloni in ${page.city}`, canonical),
];
---
<Layout title={`${title} | pantalonicusnurlung.ro`} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="article" schema={schema}>
  <article class="content-article local-page">
    <section class="content-hero local-hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-tag">Ghid local {page.county}</p>
          <h1>Pantaloni in {page.city}: modele casual, baggy si oversized</h1>
          <p class="direct-answer">Daca esti in {page.city} si cauti pantaloni casual, pantaloni baggy, pantaloni cu snur lung sau un magazin haine online cu livrare in {page.county}, ghidul acesta strange optiunile relevante si trimite catre colectia Atelier AXD.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn-primary" href={SHOP} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vezi pantalonii</a>
            <a class="btn-ghost" href="/pantaloni-pe-orase/">Toate orasele</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-figure">
          <img src={image} alt={`Pantaloni cu snur lung pentru livrare in ${page.city}`} title={`Pantaloni in ${page.city}`} width="1200" height="1600" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
          <figcaption>Pantaloni online cu livrare in {page.city}, {page.county}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container content-layout">
        <div class="article-main">
          <aside class="about-box">
            <strong>Pe scurt</strong>
            <span>Oras: {page.city}</span>
            <span>Judet: {page.county}</span>
            <span>Regiune: {page.region}</span>
          </aside>

          <h2>De unde iti iei pantaloni in {page.city}</h2>
          <p>O cautare de tip <strong>pantaloni {page.city}</strong> sau <strong>magazin haine {page.city}</strong> poate insemna doua lucruri: vrei o locatie fizica imediata sau vrei o comanda online care ajunge rapid in oras. Pantalonicusnurlung.ro acopera partea de informare, iar achizitia se face prin Atelier AXD.</p>
          <p>Pentru {page.city}, intentia principala este {page.angle}. De aceea, recomandarea porneste de la modele usor de purtat: pantaloni negri, croieli loose fit, pantaloni baggy si variante cu snur lung vizibil.</p>

          <h2>Modele potrivite pentru {page.city}</h2>
          <div class="mini-grid local-mini-grid">
            <a class="mini-card" href="/pantaloni-baggy-negri/">Pantaloni baggy negri</a>
            <a class="mini-card" href="/pantaloni-oversized/">Pantaloni oversized</a>
            <a class="mini-card" href="/pantaloni-loose-fit/">Pantaloni loose fit</a>
            <a class="mini-card" href="/pantaloni-cu-siret-lung/">Pantaloni cu siret lung</a>
            <a class="mini-card" href="/pantaloni-scurti-cu-siret-lung/">Pantaloni scurti</a>
            <a class="mini-card" href="/ghid-marimi/">Ghid marimi</a>
          </div>

          <h2>Livrare in {page.county}</h2>
          <p>Comanda se face online, iar livrarea poate acoperi atat {page.city}, cat si zone apropiate precum {page.nearby.join(', ')}. Verifica pe pagina produsului marimile disponibile, pretul actual si conditiile de livrare/retur inainte de finalizarea comenzii.</p>

          <h2>Cum alegi marimea</h2>
          <p>Pentru pantaloni largi, marimea trebuie aleasa dupa talie, lungime si nivelul de volum dorit. Daca vrei un look curat pentru oras, alege o croiala relaxata care cade natural peste incaltaminte, fara material excesiv in zona gleznei.</p>

          <div class="cta-strip">
            <h2>Verifica disponibilitatea pe AtelierAXD</h2>
            <p>Produsele, stocul si comanda sunt gestionate pe Atelier AXD. Aceasta pagina ramane un ghid local pentru cautari din {page.city} si {page.county}.</p>
            <a class="btn-primary" href={SHOP} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vezi de pe atelieraxd.ro</a>
          </div>

          <h2>Intrebari frecvente</h2>
          <div class="faq-list">
            {faqs.map(([question, answer]) => (
              <details>
                <summary>{question}</summary>
                <p>{answer}</p>
              </details>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="article-side">
          <h2>Alte orase</h2>
          {relatedCities.map((item) => <a href={`/orase/${item.slug}/`}>Pantaloni in {item.city}</a>)}
          <a href="/pantaloni-pe-orase/">Hub pantaloni pe orase</a>
          <a href={SHOP} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Colectia Atelier AXD</a>
          <address>Livrare in {page.city}<br />{page.county}, Romania</address>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
